 "gaps": [
  "The reserve's rate list and its question and answer document carry no date, and they give different light vehicle charges, so one of them is older. The two-wheeler fee is taken from the rate list on the reserve's own site.",
  "Several travel sites say private vehicles are not allowed at Pachmarhi view points. The official rate list and the official question and answer document say otherwise; this was not checked on the ground.",
  "No source found for where in Pachmarhi the view point tickets are issued.",
  "No source found for rules affecting riders at Khajuraho, Orchha or Gwalior, or for any night closure of forest roads between Khajuraho and Panna.",
  "No source found for winter fog on the Gwalior and Orchha stretch.",
  "Usual number of riding days: no source found.",
  "The highway value combines Wikipedia pages for Pachmarhi, National Highway 39 and National Highway 44; only one is cited. The road from Pachmarhi to Khajuraho was not sourced.",
  "Videos: the pages give upload dates, not filming dates, so 'filmed' is filled only where the title names a date. Uploads, in order: 2022-10, 2023-02."
